ight, and a modern feature wall with a new electric fireplace anchors the living room. The new kitchen features a brand-new centre island, ample cabinet storage for cookware and everyday pantry items and brand-new stainless steel appliances. Interior upgrades include new tile flooring in the living room and kitchen, new carpet, new interior doors, fresh interior paint and modern lighting throughout. Convenient main-floor laundry is equipped with a new washer and dryer. Additional upgrades include new shingles, a new sewer line and a newer furnace. Outside, enjoy a spacious backyard with plenty of room to relax or entertain, plus a single detached garage. Local schools, shopping, public transit and everyday amenities are all within easy reach. (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$359,900"],["Type","House"],["Style","Bungalow"],["Bedrooms","3"],["Bathrooms","2"],["Living area","1,066 sq ft"],["Lot size","5,870 sq ft"],["Year built","1959"],["Storeys","1"],["2026 City assessment","$295,500"],["Est. property tax","about $3,060/year ($255/month)"],["Neighbourhood","Rosslyn"],["Town","Edmonton"],["Postal code","T5E5A3"],["MLS® number","E4517232"],["Listed","November 22, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Refrigerator, Dishwasher, Stove, Hood Fan, Washer/Dryer Stack-Up"],["Heating","Forced air"],["Fireplace","Insert, Electric"],["Parking","Detached Garage"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level","3.33 m × 5.09 m (10'11\" × 16'8\")"],["Dining room","Main level","2.37 m × 2.56 m (7'9\" × 8'5\")"],["Kitchen","Main level","4.14 m × 4.95 m (13'7\" × 16'3\")"],["Primary Bedroom","Main level","3.09 m × 3.04 m (10'2\" × 10'0\")"],["Bedroom 2","Main level","3.51 m × 3.05 m (11'6\" × 10'0\")"],["Bedroom 3","Main level","3.51 m × 2.65 m (11'6\" × 8'8\")"]],"courtesy":"Ricky Singh, MaxWell Polaris","tax_m":255,"tax_note":{"year":2026,"per_k":"10.36","city":"Edmonton","licence":"City of Edmonton open data, licensed under the Open Government Licence – City of Edmonton","estimator":"https://ta